    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδάπᾰνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without expense, costing
				nothing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκέα κἀδάπανα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					593
				</span></i>
			, cf. Telesp <i><span class="en">
				7.8
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				10
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδαπάνως, τέρέψαι</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρένα</span> E <i><span class="en">
				<u>Or.</u>
				1176
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.133
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (prob.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of
			persons, <i>not spending</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χρημάτων εἰς τὸ δέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>VV</u>
					1251b7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καταστῆσαι τὸ κοινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Michel</u>
					1007.33
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Teos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
				111.133
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>.</div>
